+// HST Office: the File panel (backstage) in the HST frame coat. Its colours are the design tokens,
+// its left column is the Start Center's (a pill for the selected and the hovered item, the focus ring,
+// 40 px items fitted to the panel's height), the earlier look stays as the fallback, and no colour
+// is written into the panel's code outside the file of the earlier look.
+
